# Large inputs are tracked in gzipped form (see README). The uncompressed
# copies stay on disk for local use but are not pushed: GitHub rejects any
# file over 100 MB and warns above 50 MB.
BEAST/*.xml
Data/result.tsv
Data/region.result.tsv
Data/2026+Region+NCDC+MPOX.tsv
Data/324+NCDC+Nigeria 2.aln.fasta

